    "AI Notes": {
      "value": "British type designer based in Tallinn, Estonia; commercial and custom typefaces across Latin, Greek and Cyrillic, trading as the foundry East of Rome (also logos, editorial and sign painting). Reading MATD graduate (2018/19). Awards: Granshan Grand Prize 2019 (Columba), Morisawa 2019 finalist, silver at 2017 ADC Estonian Design Awards (Imperija). Typefaces: Columba, Livo Display, Imperija, Waba, Andra, Oselian; sells via Future Fonts. Independent type designer (Autonomy 4: authors his own families and runs his own micro-foundry, well evidenced). Behance @LewisMcGuffie. Verify the East of Rome IG handle before relying.",
